        {
          "id": "1518a07b-afba-404c-9672-58f91bec53a6",
          "name": "Search Tags",
          "request": {
            "name": "Search Tags",
            "description": {
              "content": "Search for tags within an account. Use this to browse the tag taxonomy, find tags by name, or list tags filtered by status.\n\n- **`query`** — Filters tags by name or display name. Searching for a parent tag also returns all of its descendants. When omitted or empty, all tags are returned.\n- **`status`** — Filters tags by status (`ACTIVE`, `INACTIVE`, `DEPRECATED`, `REJECTED`, `PENDING`). Defaults to `ACTIVE`. Set to `PENDING` to list newly discovered tag candidates awaiting review.\n- **`limit`** / **`cursor`** — Use cursor-based pagination for large result sets.\n\nEach tag in the response includes:\n- `fullPath` — a `::` delimited path of tag names from root to the tag (e.g., `marketing::social_media::instagram`).\n- `pathIds` — an ordered list of tag IDs matching each segment in `fullPath` (e.g., `[100, 101, 103]`).\n\nThese fields let you reconstruct the full hierarchy position of any tag.\n\nThe examples below assume a tag hierarchy: **Marketing > Social Media > Instagram**.\n\n#### List all active tags\n```json\n{\n  \"limit\": 20\n}\n```\n\n#### Response\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 100,\n      \"name\": \"marketing\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Marketing\",\n      \"ref\": \"eyJhY2NvdW50...\",\n      \"parentId\": null,\n      \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n      \"description\": \"Marketing related content\",\n      \"fullPath\": \"marketing\",\n      \"pathIds\": [100],\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-15T10:00:00Z\",\n      \"modifiedAt\": \"2026-01-15T10:00:00Z\",\n      \"createdBy\": \"user-1\",\n      \"modifiedBy\": \"user-1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 101,\n      \"name\": \"social_media\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Social Media\",\n      \"ref\": \"eyJhY2NvdW50...\",\n      \"parentId\": 100,\n      \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n      \"description\": \"Social media related content\",\n      \"fullPath\": \"marketing::social_media\",\n      \"pathIds\": [100, 101],\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-15T10:35:00Z\",\n      \"modifiedAt\": \"2026-01-15T10:35:00Z\",\n      \"createdBy\": \"user-1\",\n      \"modifiedBy\": \"user-1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 103,\n      \"name\": \"instagram\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Instagram\",\n      \"ref\": \"eyJhY2NvdW50...\",\n      \"parentId\": 101,\n      \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n      \"description\": \"Instagram specific content\",\n      \"fullPath\": \"marketing::social_media::instagram\",\n      \"pathIds\": [100, 101, 103],\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-16T09:00:00Z\",\n      \"modifiedAt\": \"2026-01-16T09:00:00Z\",\n      \"createdBy\": \"user-1\",\n      \"modifiedBy\": \"user-1\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextCursor\": \".....\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Search for a tag and its descendants\nSearching for `Social Media` returns the matching tag and all tags nested under it (e.g., `Instagram`).\n```json\n{\n  \"query\": \"Social Media\",\n  \"limit\": 20\n}\n```\n\n#### Response\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 101,\n      \"name\": \"social_media\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Social Media\",\n      \"ref\": \"eyJhY2NvdW50...\",\n      \"parentId\": 100,\n      \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n      \"description\": \"Social media related content\",\n      \"fullPath\": \"marketing::social_media\",\n      \"pathIds\": [100, 101],\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-15T10:35:00Z\",\n      \"modifiedAt\": \"2026-01-15T10:35:00Z\",\n      \"createdBy\": \"user-1\",\n      \"modifiedBy\": \"user-1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 103,\n      \"name\": \"instagram\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Instagram\",\n      \"ref\": \"eyJhY2NvdW50...\",\n      \"parentId\": 101,\n      \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n      \"description\": \"Instagram specific content\",\n      \"fullPath\": \"marketing::social_media::instagram\",\n      \"pathIds\": [100, 101, 103],\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-16T09:00:00Z\",\n      \"modifiedAt\": \"2026-01-16T09:00:00Z\",\n      \"createdBy\": \"user-1\",\n      \"modifiedBy\": \"user-1\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextCursor\": \".....\"\n}\n```\n\n#### List newly discovered tag candidates (pending review)\nTags with `PENDING` status are auto-discovered tags that have not yet been approved or rejected. Use this to power editorial review and governance workflows.\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n  \"limit\": 50\n}\n```\n\n#### Response\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 215,\n      \"name\": \"bedroom_pop\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Bedroom Pop\",\n      \"ref\": \"eyJhY2NvdW50...\",\n      \"parentId\": 100,\n      \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n      \"description\": \"Lo-fi pop music produced in home studios\",\n      \"fullPath\": \"marketing::bedroom_pop\",\n      \"pathIds\": [100, 215],\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-02-08T14:30:00Z\",\n      \"modifiedAt\": \"2026-02-08T14:30:00Z\",\n      \"createdBy\": \"user-1\",\n      \"modifiedBy\": \"user-1\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextCursor\": \"cursor-abc123\"\n}\n```",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "search-service",
                "accounts",
                ":accountId",
                "tags"
